msgid "Classical Optimizers {#classical-optimizers}"
msgstr "Optimizer Klasik {#classical-optimizers}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What is an optimizer? {#what-is-an-optimizer}"
msgstr "Apa itu optimizer? {#what-is-an-optimizer}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Victoria Lipinska tells us about classical optimizers, and how they function"
" as part of VQE.\n"
msgstr ""
"Victoria Lipinska menjelaskan tentang optimizer klasik, dan bagaimana "
"fungsinya sebagai bagian dari VQE.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You will hear about a few example optimizers and how they perform in the "
"presence and absence of noise.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu akan mendengar tentang beberapa contoh optimizer dan bagaimana "
"kinerjanya dalam kondisi ada dan tidak ada noise.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<IBMVideo id=\"132414916\" title=\"Victoria Lipinska explains the use of "
"classical optimizers in VQE. In particular, she covers caveats like handling"
" noise and so-called barren plateaus.\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<IBMVideo id=\"132414916\" title=\"Victoria Lipinska menjelaskan penggunaan "
"optimizer klasik dalam VQE. Secara khusus, ia membahas hal-hal seperti "
"penanganan noise dan barren plateaus.\"/>\n"

